  "notes": "{積|つ}む means to pile up, stack, load, or accumulate—physically stacking things or figuratively building up experience.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{積|つ}もる→積もる：01964_tsumoru⟧ (intransitive, to pile up by itself)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{荷物|にもつ}→荷物：00737_nimotsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{積|つ}む: to load luggage\n- ⟦{経験|けいけん}→経験：01179_keiken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{積|つ}む: to gain/accumulate experience\n- ⟦{練習|れんしゅう}→練習：05323_renshuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{積|つ}む: to build up practice\n- ⟦{努力|どりょく}→努力：03490_doryoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{積|つ}み{重|かさ}ねる→積み重ねる：06235_tsumikasaneru⟧: to make sustained effort\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{積|つ}み{重|かさ}ねる→積み重ねる：06235_tsumikasaneru⟧: to pile up, accumulate\n- ⟦{積|つ}み{込|こ}む→積み込む：16751_tsumikomu⟧: to load (onto vehicle)\n- ⟦{山積|やまづ}み→山積み：16407_yamazumi⟧: piled high like a mountain",
